    # diana "It was a long time ago, and they forgot about me completely after I failed the second trial."
    diana "那是很久以前的事了，在我第二次试炼失败后，他们就完全忘记了我。"


# game/scripts/Characters/diana.rpy:348
translate chinese_simp diana_second_visit_79aa82fa:

    # diana "What about your parents?"
    diana "你的父母呢？"


# game/scripts/Characters/diana.rpy:349
translate chinese_simp diana_second_visit_e30e4333:

    # player "Oh, that's a really long and complicated story."
    player "哦，那是一个很长很复杂的故事。"


# game/scripts/Characters/diana.rpy:350
translate chinese_simp diana_second_visit_3df46533:

    # player "But they're kinda the reason I'm in this town to begin with."
    player "不过，他们大概是我最初来到这个镇子的原因。"


# game/scripts/Characters/diana.rpy:353
translate chinese_simp diana_second_visit_4c8c45e3:

